OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader says disputed cash
OL,4,Awas handed over
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Ashfield District Council
OL,7,Fhas said "every penny" of thousands of
OL,8,Fpounds of grant money he is accused of
OL,9,Ftaking was spent on the community.
OL,11,FAshfield Independent councillor Jason
OL,12,FZadrozny is accused of setting up the
OL,13,FAshfield Heritage Society (AHS) in 2018
OL,14,Fbefore applying for #7,500 of county
OL,15,Fcouncil funding and transferring it
OL,16,Finto his personal account.
OL,18,FDuring his trial at Northampton Crown
OL,19,FCourt on Friday, he said he handed most
OL,20,Fof the money over to a colleague who
OL,21,Fwas "completely honest".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
