OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader says disputed cash
OL,4,Awas handed over
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the 46-year-old, of Stanton Hill,
OL,7,Fwho has pleaded not guilty to 12 counts
OL,8,Fof fraud and four counts of tax
OL,9,Fevasion, admitted the paperwork he
OL,10,Fsubmitted for the loans was "terrible".
